OL,3,GNEWSAFree sensory toy charity to close
OL,4,Aover funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which has been lending out
OL,7,Ffree sensory toys to those with
OL,8,Fadditional needs for 40 years is to
OL,9,Fclose over a lack of funding.
OL,11,FThe Learning Library in Spennymoor,
OL,12,FCounty Durham, relied on grants which
OL,13,Fhad become "increasingly challenging to
OL,14,Faccess with the current climate for the
OL,15,Fcharitable sector".
OL,17,FManager Sarah Machin said the charity
OL,18,Fhad helped thousands of families over
OL,19,Fthe years and was in the process of
OL,20,Fwinding down to vacate their premises
OL,21,Fin March. Five employees would be made
OL,22,Fredundant as a result, she said.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
